  "description": "*\"Alma mater, home town, blood ties—they're all but a façade!\"*\n\nThe war against organized crime waged by the government has failed miserably... and the world turned into a battlefield of mayhem ruled by one's fists. The one who unified this hell, Chairman of the Taejin Group, Jin Young-ui, has decided to open a competition of man, \"Festival of Warriors\" in search for a successor. Will our unemployed thug Kang Dae-oh rise to the top of the pyramid?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
